CIGRE14 (netlist) · GFM_A_C_LC at bus 9 + GFL_C_F_L at bus 7, fault cleared when the GFM angle enters (-pi/3, 0)
* Full CIGRE MV benchmark feeder, per unit on 25 MVA / 20 kV. Line charging is lumped as
* half the line capacitance at each end bus; loads are series RL branches to ground.
* Card order fixes the bus order (source, 1..11, ground) and the branch order (lines, loads).
.options sbase=25meg vbase=20k freq=50 units=pu method=dop853 reltol=1e-3 abstol=1e-5 residualtol=1e-4
* Time mode (clearMode = "time"): the fault is cleared at a fixed time.
* .param faultStart_s=0.10 faultComplete_s=0.101 recoveryStart_s=0.25 recoveryComplete_s=0.2501 faultVoltage=0.1
* Angle mode (clearMode = "angle"): a bolted fault at faultStart_s, cleared when the GFM angle enters
* (angleClearLower_rad, angleClearUpper_rad), not before angleClearEligible_s. faultComplete_s,
* recoveryStart_s and recoveryComplete_s are only used by the time mode.
.param faultStart_s=0.20 faultComplete_s=0.201 recoveryStart_s=0.25 recoveryComplete_s=0.2501 faultVoltage=0
+ angleClearEligible_s=0.25 angleClearLower_rad={-pi/3} angleClearUpper_rad=0
+ GFLPref=1 GFLQref=0 VSGPref=1 VSGVref=1.1 VSGwref=1

* Upstream grid: infinite bus with the fault voltage profile
Xsource source 0 Infbus kA=100
* Time mode: ramp down at faultStart_s..faultComplete_s, back up at recoveryStart_s..recoveryComplete_s.
* + Aref=PWL(0 1 {faultStart_s} 1 {faultComplete_s} {faultVoltage} {recoveryStart_s} {faultVoltage} {recoveryComplete_s} 1 1 1)
* Angle mode: step down at faultStart_s, step back up at the detected clearing time {faultClearing}
* (inf until the .meas event below fires, so the fault holds until then).
+ Aref=PWL(0 1 {faultStart_s} 1 {faultStart_s} {faultVoltage} {faultClearing} {faultVoltage} {faultClearing} 1)

* Bus line-charging capacitances (bus 9: inside the GFM as its C)
C1 1 0 0.00107144208
C2 2 0 0.0027507945600000003
C3 3 0 0.0024050455200000003
C4 4 0 0.00044453448
C5 5 0 0.0007978823999999999
C6 6 0 0.00058511376
C7 7 0 0.00063450648
* GFL current references on its own base: Iqref = -GFLQref, so Q = V * GFLQref
Xgfl 7 0 GFL_C_F_L Sb=1.5meg L=0.07 Kpcc=0.3 Kicc=1 KpPll=0.2 KiPll=0.02
+ Idref={GFLPref} Iqref={-GFLQref}
C8 8 0 0.00125001576
Xvsg 9 0 GFM_A_C_LC Sb=5meg Lv=0.3 Rv=0.1 Lf=0.07 Imax=1.5 Kp=0.05 Kp_cc=20 Ki_cc=5
+ C=0.0020706947999999995 Pref={VSGPref} Vref={VSGVref} wref={VSGwref}
C10 10 0 0.0004179384
C11 11 0 0.00012538152

