.tran 0.1m 1
* Angle mode: clearing event. min(...) > 0 inside the window, so the event fires on entering it.
* Time mode: delete this card.
.meas tran faultClearing WHEN min(wrap(@xvsg[delta])-angleClearLower_rad, angleClearUpper_rad-wrap(@xvsg[delta]))=0
+ RISE=1 FROM={angleClearEligible_s}
.probe tran delta=par('wrap(@xvsg[delta])') filterCurrentMagnitude=par('hypot(@xvsg[ild], @xvsg[ilq])')
.end
